SUMMARY:Can the Earth Help Us Heal What Divides Us? 
DESCRIPTION:Explore how environmental cooperation and Jewish earth wisdom can open new paths of connection in times of deep polarization.\n\nJoin a leadership panel of Adamah and Arava Institute staff for a conversation about how environmental cooperation and earth‑based Jewish wisdom can nurture understanding\, resilience\, and shared purpose from the Middle East to North America\, and beyond. \nRegister \nPanel Members\nArava Institute:\n\nDr. Tareq Abu Hamed\, AIES CEO\nDr. Rina Kedem\, Jordan-Israel Center for Community\, Environment\, and Research Co-Director\n\n\nAdamah:\n\nJakir Manela\, CEO\nItamar Cohn\, Adamah SF Hub Director\nDr. Shahar Sadeh\, Adamah NY Hub Director\n\nMore info to come.
URL:https://adamah.org/event/earth-day-panel/
LOCATION:Zoom
CATEGORIES:Earth Day,New York,San Francisco Bay Area
